<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1378491296"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1472727596"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="グランドエスケープ (Movie edit)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="三浦透子 / RADWIMPS"/><amll:meta key="album" value="天気の子"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:08.067"><div begin="00:48.421" end="03:01.705"><p begin="00:48.421" end="00:53.775" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">空飛ぶ羽根と引き換えに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有选择飞向天空的翅膀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra to bu ha ne to hi ki ka e ni</span></p><p begin="00:54.994" end="01:00.292" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">繋ぎ合う手を選んだ僕ら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而是选择十指相扣的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na gi a u te wo e ra n da bo ku ra</span></p><p begin="01:01.618" end="01:06.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">それでも空に魅せられて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍迷恋着天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo so ra ni mi se ra re te</span></p><p begin="01:08.117" end="01:13.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">夢を重ねるのは罪か<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做着重复的梦 这也是罪过吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me wo ka sa ne ru no wa tsu mi ka</span></p><p begin="01:16.245" end="01:21.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">夏は秋の背中を見て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夏天望着秋天的背影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu wa a ki no se na ka wo mi te</span></p><p begin="01:22.861" end="01:28.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">その顔を思い浮かべる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中浮现出他的脸庞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ka o wo o mo i u ka be ru</span></p><p begin="01:29.537" end="01:34.952" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">憧れなのか、恋なのか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在憧憬吗 这是爱情吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ko ga re na no ka ko i na no ka</span></p><p begin="01:35.985" end="01:41.537" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">叶わぬと知っていながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明知道无法实现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na wa nu to shi 't te i na ga ra</span></p><p begin="01:45.797" end="01:48.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">重力が眠りにつく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重力逐渐消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ju u ryo ku ga ne mu ri ni tsu ku</span></p><p begin="01:48.138" end="01:51.281" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">1000年に一度の今日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">千年一遇的今天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n ne n ni i chi do no kyo u</span></p><p begin="01:52.395" end="01:54.708" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">太陽の死角に立ち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">站在太阳照不到的死角</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i yo u no shi ka ku ni ta chi</span></p><p begin="01:54.718" end="01:57.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">僕らこの星を出よう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们离开这颗星球吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ko no ho shi wo de yo u</span></p><p begin="01:58.997" end="02:01.233" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">彼が眼を覚ました時<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在他醒来的时刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka re ga me wo sa ma shi ta to ki</span></p><p begin="02:01.243" end="02:04.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">連れ戻せない場所へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飞往无法再回来的地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu re mo do se na i ba sho he</span></p><p begin="02:05.563" end="02:08.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">「せーの」で大地を蹴って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喊着一二 奋力跃起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se e no de da i chi wo ke 't te</span></p><p begin="02:08.019" end="02:10.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">ここではない星へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着其他的星球</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko de wa na i ho shi he</span></p><p begin="02:14.543" end="02:16.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ko u</span></p><p begin="02:15.514" end="02:18.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">もう少しで運命の向こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还差一点就可抵达命运的彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u su ko shi de u n me i no mu ko u</span></p><p begin="02:18.705" end="02:21.939" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">もう少しで文明の向こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还差一点就可抵达文明的彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u su ko shi de bu n me i no mu ko u</span></p><p begin="02:21.047" end="02:22.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还差一点就可抵达命运的彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u su ko shi de u n me i no mu ko u</span></p><p begin="02:21.961" end="02:25.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">もう少しで運命の向こう<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u su ko shi de u n me i no mu ko u</span></p><p begin="02:25.300" end="02:26.688" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">もう少しで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还差一点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u su ko shi de</span></p><p begin="02:28.154" end="02:31.448" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">夢に僕らで帆を張って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了梦想 我们扬帆起航</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ni bo ku ra de ho wo ha 't te</span></p><p begin="02:31.478" end="02:34.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">来るべき日のために夜を越え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了注定到来的那天穿越黑夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ta ru be ki hi no ta me ni yo ru wo ko e</span></p><p begin="02:34.848" end="02:38.169" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">いざ期待だけ満タンで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们满怀期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i za ki ta i da ke ma n ta n de</span></p><p begin="02:38.179" end="02:40.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">あとはどうにかなるさと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信无论如何总会有办法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a to wa do u ni ka na ru sa to</span></p><p begin="02:40.344" end="02:42.038" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">肩を組んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们并肩前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta wo ku n da</span></p><p begin="02:42.048" end="02:47.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">怖くないわけない でも止まんない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当然不会毫无畏惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa ku na i wa ke na i</span></p><p begin="02:47.152" end="02:51.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">ピンチの先回りしたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抢在危机前面到达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pi n chi no sa ki ma wa ri shi ta 't te</span></p><p begin="02:51.020" end="02:53.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">僕らじゃしょうがない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我们能够做到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra ja sho u ga na i</span></p><p begin="02:53.699" end="03:00.075" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">僕らの恋が言う 声が言う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱情在呼喊 声音在回响</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra no ko i ga i u ko e ga i u</span></p><p begin="03:00.085" end="03:01.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">「行け」と言う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ke to i u</span></p></div></body></tt>